{"game":"Tower Defense (Last Kingdom)","id":"towers","title":"Towers","group":"Units","count":4,"summary":"Each line is built at Lv. 1 and upgraded with gold; Lv. 3 evolves into one of two towers. Higher levels unlock as you progress through the stages.","sections":[{"type":"text","text":"Gold is the cost of that step (building Lv. 1, upgrading to the next level or evolving). DEF pen.: the share of the target’s DEF the tower ignores. Range and splash are in map units. RPM is the attack-rate stat behind the speed label."},{"type":"table","title":"Gun Tower","sub":"A tower armed with a large-caliber machine gun. It attacks a single target at a high speed. Can attack aerial units.","note":"Unlocks: Lv. 3 from EX-2; Chemical Tower from EX-3; Gatling Tower from EX-4.","columns":["Tower","Level",{"label":"Gold","num":true},{"label":"ATK","num":true},{"label":"DEF pen.","num":true},"Attack speed",{"label":"Range","num":true},"Attack","Hits","Special"],"rows":[[{"img":"tower_gun_tower_lv1","caption":"Gun Tower I","size":"small"},"Lv. 1",70,11,"—",{"text":"Fast","sub":"50 RPM"},2150,"Bullet","Ground and air",""],[{"img":"tower_gun_tower_lv2","caption":"Gun Tower II","size":"small"},"Lv. 2",130,17,"—",{"text":"Fast","sub":"50 RPM"},2200,"Bullet","Ground and air",""],[{"img":"tower_gun_tower_lv3","caption":"Gun Tower III","size":"small"},"Lv. 3",190,22,"—",{"text":"Fast","sub":"50 RPM"},2250,"Bullet","Ground and air",""],[{"img":"tower_chemical_tower","caption":"Chemical Tower","size":"small"},"Evolved",300,26,"—",{"text":"Fast","sub":"60 RPM"},2450,"Bullet, 20 targets","Ground and air",""],[{"img":"tower_gatling_tower","caption":"Gatling Tower","size":"small"},"Evolved",300,12,"20%",{"text":"Very Fast","sub":"80 RPM"},2250,"Instant hit, 3 targets, splash 250","Ground and air",""]]},{"type":"table","title":"Gun Tower: evolved tower skills","note":"Learned with gold on an evolved tower, then upgraded up to Lv. 3.","columns":["Skill","Type","Description","Trigger","Effects",{"la